WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.839
GTA 6 is handing out five free things right now —

00:00:03.839 --> 00:00:06.980
and four of them have a clock on them.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.471
Miss the deadline, they’re gone forever.

00:00:10.471 --> 00:00:14.460
And number five expires while you’re still installing.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.771
Five: the Vintage Vice City Pack —

00:00:17.771 --> 00:00:22.456
a ’55 Vapid Stanier, a Vice City garage, retro outfits,

00:00:22.456 --> 00:00:24.798
and a Kingpin weapon pattern.

00:00:24.798 --> 00:00:30.420
Free if you own the game before eleven fifty-nine tomorrow night.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.841
Four: a free month of GTA+.

00:00:33.841 --> 00:00:38.223
Half a million in GTA Online cash every month,

00:00:38.223 --> 00:00:40.171
free cars on rotation.

00:00:40.171 --> 00:00:43.579
Claim it by March 2027 on PlayStation —

00:00:43.579 --> 00:00:46.500
a hundred eighty days on Xbox.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.268
Three: six Twitch chain badges.

00:00:49.268 --> 00:00:52.897
Watch an hour of GTA 6 a day —

00:00:52.897 --> 00:00:56.980
one chain per day — before November thirtieth.

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:00.586
Two: collect all twelve drop items

00:01:00.586 --> 00:01:03.691
and the Golden Iguana badge unlocks.

00:01:03.691 --> 00:01:08.350
Unclaimed rewards? They expire the second the campaign ends.

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:10.759
One: actual free copies.

00:01:10.759 --> 00:01:14.577
Twitch drops game codes daily through November —

00:01:14.577 --> 00:01:17.440
and Kick put up ten thousand.

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:20.090
Five free things, one rule:

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:23.530
the clock doesn’t wait for your install bar.

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:26.332
Which one are you grabbing first?

00:01:26.332 --> 00:01:30.170
One, two, three, four, or five — comment the number.

